flowchart TD

    U[User]

    G[LangGraph]

    R[Intent Router<br/>LLM + keyword fallback]

    T1[Log Interaction]
    T2[Edit Interaction]
    T3[Search HCP]
    T4[Retrieve History]
    T5[Suggest Follow-up]
    T6[Unsupported<br/>no database]

    S[Service Layer]

    REPO[Repository Layer]

    DB[(PostgreSQL)]

    U --> G
    G --> R

    R --> T1
    R --> T2
    R --> T3
    R --> T4
    R --> T5
    R --> T6

    T1 --> S
    T2 --> S
    T3 --> S
    T4 --> S
    T5 --> S

    S --> REPO
    REPO --> DB